: ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Read the sentences. </span><span class=\"bullet\">Type in the missing words.</span><span class=\"bullet\">Choose from these words:  <span class=\"product-color-text\">might as well ask</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">she might as well</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">they might as well</span> and <span class=\"product-color-text\">may as well</span></span>."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 10}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": ""}, {"time": "0", "text": "Many restaurateurs are going green, but employee motivation may not be the first thing that comes to mind. Incorporating green practices into your restaurant has many employee-related benefits.<br/>\nHow can you increase employee motivation? It's simple. You might as well harness the power of the bright minds of your employees. You should ask your staff what they would like to see. How do they envision their ideal workplace? What is your organization not doing that would make a difference to your employees? You may as well sit down with your team on a regular basis and brainstorm ideas.", "id": 1, "image": ""}, {"time": "46000", "text": "From there, you ought to arm your employees with the power to use their skills and ideas to implement change that will benefit the organization. You'd better increase employee motivation further by offering incentives to the person that comes up with the most innovative idea to solve a problem, save energy, reduce water use or waste. By involving your employees in this process, the restaurant will benefit from a staff that is more engaged, proud and committed.", "id": 2, "image": ""}, {"time": "79000", "text": "Keep the motivation going. You'd better share your successes and celebrate your accomplishments by rewarding your hard-working staff on a job well done. If your energy bills were down five per cent because of an employee's idea, you might as well share that with the team and give them a pat on the back to show the team the value of their efforts and your appreciation. When your organization is doing important things, you may just as well find that people want to be apart of that and will be motivated by it.<br/>Creating a workplace that cares about the environment generates a feeling of pride among your employees which will result in a team that is excited about coming to work and making a difference in their community!", "id": 3, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn11le05ob06re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}